   678	the existing two-channel checks; A9.1's six-field stable set (:162) and A9.4's contract and verdict stability
   679	(:267-283), since `utc_assessment` is outside the stable six; A9's "no lower time bound or priority" (:46-47); A8.3
   680	and A8.5, which supply no evidence for option (e); A9.6's issuer invariant and guarantee 2's body, its chain-time
   681	meaning and its capture proviso; A9's public-publication issuer duty ("Changed in effect", :495-500); the scenario
   682	mapping's verdicts, fixtures and safe-decision categories. `docs/V1-PROFILE.md` is not changed by this amendment:
   683	A10.5 states its existing order, and the profile changes that rows 20–39 would need (memo, Part 3, "Minimal spec and
   684	verifier changes") are made only after the author's ruling. A1.6 (:485-505) stays standing: its clock wording is
   685	qualified for V1 by A10.1, and its parenthetical "a reorganization deeper than k is out of model" uses the same
   686	phrase as rows 13–14, while its governing clause ("anchors at depth ≥ k are treated as permanent") already matches
   687	A10.3. A9's header still reads "PROPOSED"; its signing act is commit `2ad3489` under the house form, and this
   688	amendment does not change that.
   689	
   690	**In sum:** thirty-nine rows. Rows 1–14 and 17–19 are OWNER DECISIONS and add no mechanism. Rows 15–16 and 20–39
   691	await the author's ruling. By kind: fifteen narrow claims (rows 1–11, 13–16), one correction to the registered
   692	encoding (row 19), five clarifications (rows 12, 17, 18, 23, 24), thirteen broadenings (rows 20–22, 25–31, 37–39)
   693	and five gate changes (rows 32–36; row 33 also states its scope change). The broadenings add mechanism: one reported
   694	assessment and one named assumption (A10.1.1); one trust-file field, two checks, three reason codes, closure
   695	invariants, release stamping and one issuer invariant (A10.4.1). The scenario mapping's verdicts are unchanged;
   696	option (e) deliberately rejects one new case, a receipt under unlisted keys. No existing check, verdict, parameter
   697	or vector is changed.
