   785	- **`confirmed_at`** = nTime(h* + 5): the including block plus five successors, k = 6 (SPEC R-3.45, R-4.42). A
   786	  failure gives `INVALID`: `TIME_BEFORE_DECLARED_EPSILON`, `TIME_AFTER_DECLARED_DELTA` or `CONFIRMATION_LATE`.
